[enu default]
//////////////ALTAR
ALTAR_01_DLG_01 =
"\cDYou noticed an inviting aura emanating from the mushroom. Your senses beckon new experiences.";
ALTAR_01_DLG_01a =
"\cQ[Origin] \cDMake a silent prayer.";

//////////////SHROOM
SHRM_02 = "Abnormal Mushroom";
SHRM_INTRO =
"\cDYou noticed an inviting aura emanating from the mushroom. Your senses beckon new experiences.";
SHRM_INTRO_1 =
"\cD[Listen to the colors]";
SHRM_INTRO_2 =
"\cD[Eat the sounds]";

SHRM_SOUND1 = "\cDNothing happens.";
SHRM_SOUND1a = "\cD[Wait]";
SHRM_SOUND2 =
"\cDYou slip into a trance. Losing all awareness of self...\n\n"
"Once awakened. You are now a frog. You're hungry, famished, desperate for a meal. You can only eat. Your instincts demand it.";
SHRM_SOUND2a = "\cD[Look for something to eat]";
SHRM_SOUND3 = 
"\cDBut there is nothing in sight to eat. Except... an electrical signal. Yes. You're convinced it is nourishing, agreeable, appetizing even. "
"It will sate your endless hunger.";
SHRM_SOUND3a = "\cD[Eat the signal]";
SHRM_SOUND4 = 
"\cDYou consume the signal. It has a lasting sweet aftertaste to it. Your senses are amplified. You feel amazing.\n\n"
"And who could've guessed that there would be more? A symphony of soundwaves and exotic colors surround you. Waiting to be devoured.";
SHRM_SOUND4a = "\cD[Continue eating]";
SHRM_SOUND5 =
"\cDYou gorge down the music. The experience is orgasmic, like a trillion feel-good receptors firing off in every single cell of your being.\n\n"
"Bitter, deranged, familiar, light, hot, intense, crowded, pressure, cold, and many more sensations melding until there are zero differentiation.";
SHRM_SOUND6 =
"\cDYou are completely overwritten. No traces of you are recognizable. What exists now is simply beyond this world. You can only recall distorted echoes "
"of your former self. You are now fragmented, drifting in-between two worlds for eternity.";
SHRM_COLOR1 =
"\cDYou slip into a trance. Seeing beyond the experience of self...\n\n"
"You are a lotus flower, existing in a state of complete harmony. One day, you are visited by a red light. It says in a playful manner:\n"
"\cJ''All things are meant to change, even the Sun and the Earth. You are no different.''\cD\n\n"
"A moment pass -- then the light departs.";
SHRM_COLOR2 =
"\cDOn the second day, you are visited by a green and blue light. The green light says:\n"
"\cJ''There are many more visitors who will make their way to you soon. Be prepared.''\n\n"
"\cDAfterward, the blue light says:\n"
"\cJ''Time is running out.''\cD\n\n"
"A moment pass -- then the lights depart.";
SHRM_COLOR3 =
"\cDOn the third day, more lights have now arrived, each whispering an unnerving truth into your mind.\n\n"
"One reminded you that this existence will continue to expand and contract endlessly, that the present configuration is bound to reappear. You will live this exact life "
"again with zero recollection. You will never escape the spiraling whirlpool of infinity.";
SHRM_COLOR4 =
"\cDOn the fourth day, the colors are now multiplying and collapsing into each other. Every collision triggering a recursive expansion of light rays. "
"Their noise is now a deafening screech, threatening to destabilize your very ontological nature as the vibration ripples its way through your mind.\n\n"
"You are completely dissolved by the lights.";
SHRM_COLOR5 =
"\cDOn the seventh day, you awake in a joyous scene, immersed in sacred matters. You are a whirlwind of thoughts manifested. Product of a higher order.";